{"id":393,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"愛と誠で世界を見つめる横浜女学院","feature_description":"横浜女学院中学校高等学校は、プロテスタントのキリスト教精神と「愛と誠」の教育を基盤に、女子の人間教育を行う学校です。国際教養クラスとアカデミークラスを備え、CLILやESD、探究、グローバル教育を通して、学ぶ喜びと真理の探究を広げます。学習と活動の両立もはっきり打ち出しています。6年間で責任や役割も学べます。日々の対話からも成長できます。","clubs":[{"id":7352,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yjg.y-gakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club.php","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7353,"name":"体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yjg.y-gakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club.php","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7354,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yjg.y-gakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club.php","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7355,"name":"チアリーディング部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yjg.y-gakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club.php","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7356,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yjg.y-gakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club.php","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7357,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yjg.y-gakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club.php","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7358,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yjg.y-gakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club.php","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7359,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yjg.y-gakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club.php","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7360,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yjg.y-gakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club.php","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7361,"name":"文芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yjg.y-gakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club.php","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7362,"name":"理科部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yjg.y-gakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club.php","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7363,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yjg.y-gakuin.ed.jp/schoollife/club.php","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7364,"name":"ＹＣＡ部（Yokohama Christ